  'USA Green Card Lottery 2026: Complete DV Program Guide',
  'blog/usa-green-card-lottery-dv-program-guide',
  '<h2>USA Green Card Lottery (DV Program) 2026</h2><p>The Diversity Visa Lottery makes up to 55,000 immigrant visas available annually to people from countries with low immigration to the US.</p><h2>Eligibility</h2><p>You must be born in an eligible country and have a high school education or 2 years of qualifying work experience.</p><h2>How to Apply</h2><ol><li>Visit dvprogram.state.gov during the registration window (typically October-November)</li><li>Complete the E-DV form</li><li>Upload a qualifying photo</li><li>Submit only ONE entry</li><li>Save your confirmation number</li></ol><h2>After Selection</h2><ul><li>Complete Form DS-260</li><li>Gather civil documents</li><li>Complete medical examination</li><li>Attend visa interview</li><li>Pay the $330 fee</li></ul><h2>Tips</h2><ul><li>The application is FREE — never pay anyone to submit</li><li>Check results only at dvprogram.state.gov</li><li>Beware of scam emails</li></ul><p>Approximately 12-15 million people apply annually, with about 100,000 selected.</p>',
  'Complete guide to the USA Green Card Lottery (DV Program) 2026. Eligibility, application process, deadlines, and tips.',
  'USA Green Card Lottery 2026 | DV Program Complete Guide',
  'US Green Card Lottery DV Program 2026. Eligibility, application, deadlines, and fraud prevention tips.',
