  'Digital Nomad Visas 2026: Complete Guide to Remote Work Abroad',
  'blog/digital-nomad-visa-guide-2026',
  '<h2>Digital Nomad Visas 2026</h2><p>Dozens of countries now offer dedicated Digital Nomad Visas. These visas let you live and work legally abroad while employed by foreign companies or clients.</p><h2>Top Destinations</h2><h3>1. Portugal</h3><p>Min income: €3,040/month. Duration: 1 year, renewable.</p><h3>2. Spain</h3><p>Min income: €2,520/month. Duration: Up to 3 years. 15% tax rate.</p><h3>3. Dubai, UAE</h3><p>Min income: $3,500/month. Duration: 1 year. No income tax.</p><h3>4. Thailand (LTR Visa)</h3><p>Min income: $80,000/year. Duration: Up to 10 years.</p><h3>5. Indonesia/Bali</h3><p>Min savings: $130,000. Duration: 5-10 years.</p><h3>6. Croatia</h3><p>Min income: €2,539/month. Duration: 1 year. Tax-free foreign income.</p><h2>How to Choose</h2><ul><li>Budget and cost of living</li><li>Timezone alignment with clients</li><li>Internet reliability</li><li>Nomad community and coworking spaces</li><li>Healthcare quality</li></ul>',
  'Guide to digital nomad visas in 2026. Compare destinations, requirements, income thresholds, and tax benefits for remote workers.',
  'Digital Nomad Visas 2026 | Best Countries for Remote Work',
  'Best digital nomad visa programs 2026. Requirements, income thresholds, tax benefits, and top destinations.',
