  'Work Visa Guide 2026: Top Countries Hiring Foreign Workers',
  'blog/work-visa-guide-top-countries-2026',
  '<h2>Work Visa Guide 2026</h2><p>With global labor shortages, many countries are making it easier for skilled workers to obtain work visas.</p><h2>Top Countries</h2><h3>Canada - Express Entry</h3><p>Points-based system. Target: 485,000+ permanent residents in 2026.</p><h3>Australia - Skilled Migration</h3><p>Subclass 482, 189, 190 visas. In-demand: healthcare, IT, engineering.</p><h3>Germany - Opportunity Card</h3><p>Points-based Chancenkarte for skilled workers to find employment.</p><h3>UK - Skilled Worker Visa</h3><p>Min salary: £26,200. Requires approved sponsor. Processing: 3-8 weeks.</p><h3>Singapore - Employment Pass</h3><p>Min salary: S$5,600/month. Processing: 3-8 weeks.</p><h2>In-Demand Skills</h2><ul><li>Software Engineering & AI</li><li>Healthcare</li><li>Cybersecurity</li><li>Renewable Energy</li><li>Skilled Trades</li></ul>',
